title: 'cumulus-collator: emit the scheduling-signal tail as validate_block does'
doc:
- audience: Node Dev
  description: |-
    The collator re-encodes a block's scheduling UMP signals with the same parse `validate_block`
    applies, instead of passing them through raw. Signals the PVF would reject skip the collation.
crates:
- name: cumulus-client-collator
  bump: patch
- name: cumulus-primitives-core
  bump: minor
